      "content": "That sweet, heavy mist is a sign of the garden's intense energy, and while it may feel overwhelming, it is likely a result of the specific plant strains being cultivated rather than harmful particulates. You can create a barrier by planting a row of fast-growing, dense shrubs or tall grasses between your property lines to naturally filter and absorb those airborne particles before they reach your home. Additionally, installing a high-quality air purifier with a HEPA filter inside your home will help capture any remaining micro-particles, ensuring your breathing remains clear and your peace of mind intact.",
